    <node id="&quot;KEITH BUTLER (AMERICAN FOOTBALL)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Keith Butler (American football) is an American football coach and former player for the Seattle Seahawks and Memphis State University (now University of Memphis). He served as defensive coordinator for the Pittsburgh Steelers and was named an AP All-American in his senior year."</data>
